---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer" description="AapkaNeta.org ka disclaimer — tathyon ke srot, seemaen aur zimmedaari.">
  <style>
    .l-hero { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 44px 0; }
    .l-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .l-hero p { color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 680px; }
    .l-block { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .l-block h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block p, .l-block li { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
    .l-block p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block ul { margin: 10px 0 10px 22px; }
    .l-block li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  </style>

  <div class="l-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p>Site padhne se pehle ye zaroor samajh lein.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>1. Tathya, faisla nahi</h2>
      <p>Ye site tathya prastut karti hai — faisla nahi sunati. Kisi neta ke profile par \"kaam\" dikhna uski tareef nahi hai, aur khali profile us par aarop nahi hai. Khali profile ka matlab hai: <b>record jama ho raha hai</b>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>2. Srot par nirbharta</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Halafnama data</b> — Election Commission ke naamankan halafname aur myneta.info se liya gaya hai. Hum ise badalte nahi.</li>
        <li><b>Kaam ki entries</b> — news reports, RTI jawab aur sarkari dastavezon par aadharit hain. Har entry ke saath srot ka link diya gaya hai.</li>
        <li><b>MP fund data</b> — sarkari e-SAKSHI portal se, jaise-kaa-taisa.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Moola srot me galti ho to wo yahan bhi dikhegi. Galti mile to <a href="/methodology#correction" style="color:#fbbf24">correction bhejein</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>3. Poornata ki guarantee nahi</h2>
      <p>Koi bhi profile \"poori list\" ka daawa nahi karti. Har neta ka har kaam track karna sambhav nahi — ye record lagataar badhta hai, aur khaali jagah ka matlab gair-maujoodgi nahi.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>4. Rajneetik tatasthata</h2>
      <p>Site kisi party, gathbandhan ya vichardhara ka samarthan ya virodh nahi karti. Vivaad wale section me uplabdh hone par <b>dono paksh</b> diye jate hain.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>5. Kanooni seema</h2>
      <p>Ye site kanooni salah nahi deti. Aaparaadhik mamle jaise samvedansheel tathya sirf sarkari record se liye jate hain, apne shabdon me nahi. Kisi vivaad par nirnay lene se pehle mool srot aur kanooni salahkaar se paramarsh karein.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>6. Teesre paksh ke links</h2>
      <p>Bahari sites (news, myneta.info, sarkari portal) ki samagri unki apni zimmedaari hai. Hum unki samagri ki satyata ki guarantee nahi dete.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
